        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A an autosomal recessive disease that is characterized by autosomal recessive inheritance of bilateral or unilateral clinical anophthalmia or microphthalmia and synostosis, syndactyly, oligodactyly and/or polydactyly that has material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the SMOC1 gene on chromosome 14q24.</obo:IAO_0000115>
