        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An osteochondrodysplasia characterized by short-limbed dwarfism, anisospondyly, and neonatal lethality that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the HSPG2 gene on chromosome 1p36.</obo:IAO_0000115>
