        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A focal dystonia characterized by autosomal dominant inheritance of adult-onset cervical dystonia with onset typically in the fourth or fifth decade of life that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the CACNA1B gene on chromosome 9q34.</obo:IAO_0000115>
