        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A thrombocytopenia characterized by autosomal dominant inheritance of macrothrombocytopenia with normal platelet aggregation that has material_basis_in mutation in the TUBB1 gene on chromosome 20q13.3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
